OL,3,GNEWSAFour people suffer 'serious
OL,4,Ainjuries' in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people suffered serious injuries
OL,7,Fin a two-car crash in Derbyshire.
OL,9,FDerbyshire Police was called to the
OL,10,FA515 between Sudbury and New Road, near
OL,11,FHarehill, at about 11:45 BST.
OL,13,FThe near two-mile section of road was
OL,14,Fclosed while recovery work took place.
OL,16,FThe force added the injuries were not
OL,17,Fbelieved to be life-threatening.
